"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Elena ອະດີດນັກກິລາມືອາຊີບ, "
"ເພິ່ນເປັນຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານຊັ້ນນຳດ້ານຍຸດທະສາດການຫຼິ້ນຄູ່. "
"ການເຝິກຊ້ອມຕາມສະຖານະການຕົວຈິງຂອງເພິ່ນຈະປ່ຽນແປງວິທີການອ່ານເກມຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ.</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_coaches
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Fernando is a premier "
"Tactical Coach specializing in game tactics. Through his expert situational "
"drills, he helps players master the art of reading the game and executing "
"winning tactics.</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Fernando "
"ເປັນຄູເຝິກດ້ານຍຸດທະວິທີຊັ້ນນຳທີ່ມີຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານສະເພາະດ້ານແຜນການຫຼິ້ນ. "
"ຜ່ານການເຝິກຊ້ອມຈຳລອງສະຖານະການ, ເພິ່ນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກກິລາຊ່ຽວຊານໃນການອ່ານເກມ ແລະ "
"ນຳໃຊ້ຍຸດທະວິທີສູ່ໄຊຊະນະ.</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_coaches
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Julien combines physical "
"conditioning and padel technique to give you a decisive edge on the court.</"
"span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Julien "
"ປະສົມປະສານການປັບສະພາບຮ່າງກາຍ ແລະ ເຕັກນິກກິລາພາເດວ ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມໄດ້ປຽບຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງໃນເດີ່ນ.</"
"span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_coaches
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Sofia turns every session "
"into a fun and rewarding experience. She leads beginner and junior programs "
"with her unique teaching approach.</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.57);\">Sofia "
"ປ່ຽນທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງເຝິກແອບໃຫ້ເປັນປະສົບການທີ່ມ່ວນຊື່ນ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄ່າ. ເພິ່ນເປັນຜູ້ນຳພາຫຼັກສູດຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເຍົາວະຊົນ ດ້ວຍວິທີການສອນທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກ.</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_home
msgid "<strong class=\"s_rating_title\">Rating</strong>"
msgstr "<strong class=\"s_rating_title\">ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ</strong>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting:</strong> Automatically log payments, close sessions, "
"and\n"
"                    generate tax reports."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ:</strong> ບັນທຶກການຊຳລະເງິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ປິດຮອບການຂາຍ, ແລະ\n"
"                    ສ້າງລາຍງານອາກອນ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated Lead Generation:</strong> Every submission on your "
"\"Contact Us\"\n"
"                    page instantly creates a brand-new opportunity in your "
"<strong>CRM App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການສ້າງລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</strong> ທຸກໆການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໜ້າ \"ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ\"\n"
"                    ຈະສ້າງໂອກາດການຂາຍໃໝ່ໃນ <strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong> ຂອງທ່ານທັນທີ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Availability:</strong> Exclusive to Friday evenings."
msgstr "<strong>ຊ່ວງເວລາໃຫ້ບໍລິການ:</strong> ສະເພາະຕອນແລງວັນສຸກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Cafeteria:</strong> Running their on-site food and beverage\n"
"                            services."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຮ້ານອາຫານ-ເຄື່ອງດື່ມ:</strong> ດຳເນີນການບໍລິການອາຫານ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງດື່ມ\n"
"                            ພາຍໃນສະໂມສອນ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Court Rentals:</strong> Managing bookings and scheduling for\n"
"                            players."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການເຊົ່າເດີ່ນ:</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງການຈອງ ແລະ ຈັດຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບ\n"
"                            ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Duration:</strong> 60-minute playing sessions."
msgstr "<strong>ໄລຍະເວລາ:</strong> ຮອບຫຼິ້ນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<strong>Elisa D.<br/></strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgba(45, 27, 61, 0.66);\">Member since 3 years</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Elisa D.<br/></strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgba(45, 27, 61, 0.66);\">ເປັນສະມາຊິກມາແລ້ວ 3 ປີ</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.footer_custom
msgid ""
"<strong>Email<br/></strong>\n"
"                                        hello@padelo.example.com"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອີເມວ<br/></strong>\n"
"                                        hello@padelo.example.com"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Flexible Fulfillment:</strong> Customers can choose between "
"convenient\n"
"                    paid home delivery or free in-club pickup."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດສົ່ງທີ່ຍືດຍຸ່ນ:</strong> ລູກຄ້າສາມາດເລືອກລະຫວ່າງການຈັດສົ່ງເຖິງບ້ານ\n"
"                    ແບບມີຄ່າທຳນຽມ ຫຼື ຮັບສິນຄ້າຟຣີທີ່ສະໂມສອນ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Frequency:</strong> Slots start every 30 minutes to maximize court\n"
"                    turnover and availability."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄວາມຖີ່:</strong> ແຕ່ລະຊ່ວງເວລາເລີ່ມທຸກໆ 30 ນາທີ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການໝູນວຽນ\n"
"                    ແລະ ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຂອງເດີ່ນໃຫ້ສູງສຸດ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>From the CRM app:</strong> Track client interactions in real time "
"and use\n"
"                    the <strong>Sales\n"
"                        App</strong> to quickly shoot over tailored "
"quotations for B2B leads or\n"
"                    custom customer requests, or use the "
"<strong>Subscription App</strong> for new\n"
"                    members."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈາກແອັບ CRM:</strong> ຕິດຕາມການຕິດຕໍ່ພົວພັນກັບລູກຄ້າແບບສົດໆ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້\n"
"                    <strong>ແອັບການຂາຍ</strong> "
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບກຸ່ມລູກຄ້າ B2B ຫຼື\n"
"                    ຕາມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງລູກຄ້າຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ຫຼື ນຳໃຊ້ "
"<strong>ແອັບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</strong> ສຳລັບສະມາຊິກໃໝ່."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Full Restaurant Capabilities:</strong> Do you have a kitchen or\n"
"                            seated dining area? Map out a visual table "
"layout right in the system\n"
"                            and integrate a digital <strong>Kitchen Display "
"System (KDS)</strong> to\n"
"                            seamlessly coordinate orders between the floor "
"and the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບຮ້ານອາຫານຄົບວົງຈອນ:</strong> ທ່ານມີຫ້ອງຄົວ ຫຼື\n"
"                            ພື້ນທີ່ນັ່ງຮັບປະທານອາຫານບໍ່? ອອກແບບຜັງໂຕະໃນລະບົບໄດ້ທັນທີ\n"
"                            ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບລະບົບຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃນເຮືອນຄົວ <strong>(KDS)</"
"strong> ເພື່ອ\n"
"                            ປະສານງານລາຍການສັ່ງອາຫານລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຮ້ານ ແລະ "
"ເຮືອນຄົວໄດ້ຢ່າງລຽບງ່າຍ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Gear &amp; Equipment:</strong> Handling basic sports gear and\n"
"                            inventory."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອຸປະກອນກິລາ:</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງອຸປະກອນກິລາພື້ນຖານ ແລະ\n"
"                            ສາງສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Instant Checkout:</strong> If a player needs gear right before a "
"match or\n"
"                    wants to buy items directly at the club, staff can "
"process the transaction\n"
"                    instantly using the dedicated Shop POS system."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຊຳລະເງິນທັນໃຈ:</strong> ຖ້າຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຕ້ອງການອຸປະກອນກ່ອນການແຂ່ງຂັນ ຫຼື\n"
"                    ຕ້ອງການຊື້ສິນຄ້າຢູ່ສະໂມສອນໂດຍກົງ, ພະນັກງານສາມາດເຮັດທຸລະກຳ\n"
"                    ໄດ້ທັນທີໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບ POS ສຳລັບຮ້ານຄ້າ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Instant Member Scanning:</strong> Link unique barcodes to your\n"
"                            members' profiles. Staff can simply scan a "
"physical or digital\n"
"                            membership card at the bar to instantly apply "
"their preferential\n"
"                            discounts or tab the drinks to their account."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການສະແກນສະມາຊິກທັນທີ:</strong> ເຊື່ອມໂຍງບາໂຄດສະເພາະເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງສະມາຊິກ.\n"
"                            ພະນັກງານພຽງແຕ່ສະແກນບັດສະມາຊິກຕົວຈິງ ຫຼື ບັດດິຈິທັລຢູ່ບາຣ໌ "
"ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນຫຼຸດພິເສດ\n"
"                            ຫຼື ບັນທຶກຄ່າເຄື່ອງດື່ມລົງໃນບັນຊີຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Internal Counter Bookings:</strong> For walk-ins or phone "
"reservations,\n"
"                    counter employees can seamlessly book courts on behalf "
"of members by navigating\n"
"                    to the <strong>Appointments\n"
"                        &gt; Resource Schedule</strong> menu."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈອງຜ່ານໜ້າເຄົາເຕີ:</strong> ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ຍ່າງເຂົ້າມາ ຫຼື ໂທມາຈອງ,\n"
"                    ພະນັກງານປະຈຳເຄົາເຕີສາມາດຈອງເດີ່ນແທນສະມາຊິກໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກ "
"ໂດຍເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ\n"
"                    <strong>ການນັດໝາຍ\n"
"                        &gt; ຕາຕະລາງຊັບພະຍາກອນ</strong>."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<strong>Julien M.<br/></strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgba(45, 27, 61, 0.66);\">VIP Member</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Julien M.<br/></strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgba(45, 27, 61, 0.66);\">ສະມາຊິກ VIP</span>\n"
"                                                    <br/>"

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
