#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Via our online platform, under the <a href=\"/appointment\" "
"class=\"o_translate_inline\">\"<u><strong>Courts\" section</strong></u></a>. "
"Select your date and time slot, then confirm. You will receive a "
"confirmation email immediately."
